 702:     Batting squad: Rahul (pos 1), Pathum (pos 2), Rana (pos 5).
 703:     Pathum is DISMISSED with a witnessed FOW entry. Rahul and Rana
 704:     are batting. This is the moment immediately before the malformed
 705:     phase-economy graphic at F339.
 706:     """
 707:     from eyes.scoreboard import Scoreboard
 708:     sb = Scoreboard()
