 911:     Mirrors the live deadlock: extractor strip will show RANA + RAHUL,
 912:     Pathum is "missing from extractor" but the wicket-tick gate would
 913:     refuse to re-dismiss because `_last_autodismiss_wickets == 1`
 914:     (already auto-dismissed Pathum once at this wicket count).
 915:     """
 916:     from eyes.scoreboard import Scoreboard
 917:     sb = Scoreboard()
