1627: # INFO-PANEL bowler-strip gate (Fix 8, 2026-04-26): when vision
1628: # description contains a stats-overlay keyword (`_INFO_PANEL_KEYWORDS`
1629: # — "IPL CAREER", "CAREER", "IN T20", "HEAD TO HEAD", etc.), strip
1630: # the bowler / bowler_name / bowler_figures fields from `extracted`.
1631: # Closes the F619 DC-vs-PBKS pattern where "YUZVENDRA CHAHAL IPL
1632: # CAREER MATCHES 181 WICKETS 225 ECONOMY 8.0" overlay was extracted
1633: # as bowler=Chahal even though Marco Jansen was bowling the over.
1634: # Score / wickets are not stripped — ConsistentReadTracker bounds
1635: # those.  Bowler is stripped because (a) bowler ingest bypasses the
1636: # tracker, (b) bowler is sourced fresh on every active-play frame so
1637: # one dropped frame loses no data, (c) future-bowler name-drops in
1638: # stats overlays are a documented pattern.
1639: # See backlog "P1: Bowler stats graphic misread as bowler-change".
1640: # ---------------------------------------------------------------------
